       --ggrreeeenn _g_x _g_y
              specifies the CIE _x and _y co-ordinates of the  green  illuminant
              of the color system and selects the custom system.


       --bblluuee _b_x _b_y
              specifies the CIE _x and _y co-ordinates of the blue illuminant of
